      "q": "What are critical thinking games for kids without screens?",
      "a": "Critical thinking games are activities that challenge kids to analyze, evaluate, and solve problems using logic and reasoning. Examples include board games like chess, puzzles, riddles, and treasure hunts — all done without any digital device."
